      {
        "id": "p79-q3-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Find the mean, mode and median for Geoff’s marks.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": {
            "format": "maths-editor-document-v1",
            "version": 1,
            "blocks": [
              {
                "id": "p79-q3-a-answer",
                "type": "paragraph",
                "fontSize": null,
                "align": "left",
                "spaceBefore": 0,
                "spaceAfter": 2,
                "lineHeight": 1.4,
                "indent": 0,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Mean: ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "4.125",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " marks; mode: ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "6",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": " marks; median: ",
                    "marks": []
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "math",
                    "latex": "4.5\\text{ marks}",
                    "display": false
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "",
                    "marks": []
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\bar{x}&=\\frac{6+3+6+3+6+2+6+1}{8}\\\\\\bar{x}&=\\frac{33}{8}\\\\\\bar{x}&=4.125\\text{ marks}\\end{align*}$$\n\n6 occurs four times, more often than any other mark. The mode is $6$ marks.\n\nOrdered marks: $1, 2, 3, 3, 6, 6, 6, 6$.\n\nThe fourth and fifth marks are 3 and 6.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Median}&=\\frac{3+6}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=\\frac{9}{2}\\\\\\text{Median}&=4.5\\text{ marks}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 56
      },
